# Scratch space for the headless render harness (screenshots, fixtures).
.probe/

# Build output is COMMITTED on purpose — see AGENTS.md section 12.
# The DSH Store reviews a fixed commit and refuses to run `prepare` to fill in
# missing runtime files, so `lib/` has to be in the tree. Never edit it by hand;
# run `pnpm run build` and commit the result together with the sources.
